    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d323-a1">

                <pb facs="0626" n="578" sameAs="frus:frus1877/pg578"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 148.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Cipher telegram from Mr. Maynard to the Secretary
                        of State.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1877-04-28"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 28,
                        1877</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Evarts</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>Russian vice-consul at Mytilene asks American protection for Russian subjects. No
                    German agent there.</p>
                <closer><signed>MAYNARD.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
